{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1505528-sylvix-s-essence-homebrew-collection","id":1505528,"title":"Sylvix's Essence homebrew collection","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-03-16T23:33:01-07:00","id":1505528,"title":"Sylvix's Essence homebrew collection","content":"I realized I hadn't shared my homebrew collection since the forum got updated.<br /> <br /> I've been working on a large <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/19R95uesdJIYSfx1uD4n_FIBTxxbQ1CHw\" target=\"_blank\">collection of homebrew for Exalted Essence</a><br /> <br /> Currently included are<ul><li>A collection of over <b>t</b><b>wo dozen Artifacts</b> and a few <b>Hearthstones</b> of various ratings, including an adaption of Janest's Grimscythe <b>Final Season</b> and a wonder with linked initiation ritual for making service contracts with demons instead of binding rolls.</li> <li>Rules for <b>Artifact Ships</b> with an example <b>airship,</b> <b>Siege Weapon tag</b>, and an early take on <b>Warstriders</b>.</li> <li>A new Merit to handle <b>Supernatural Features</b> including mutations and divine heritage.</li> <li><b>Charms</b> and <b>modes</b>; including conversions of the 3e <b>DB sorcery charms</b>, an Infernal <b>Hell-On-Earth charm</b> similar to Boundary Marking Meditation, <b>ten-plagues</b> and <b>dance hazard</b> solar charms, and <b>Dorian Grey painting</b> and <b>ghost marriage</b> abyssal charms.</li> <li>\u200bTwo new <b>martial arts</b> made for Essence; the harnassed violent intent of <b>Shattered Gem style</b> inspired by Maya from K6BD and the battle-sorcery integration of <b>Luminous Pearl style</b>.</li> <li>A conversion of the previewed <b>Thousand Blades</b> and <b>Silver-Voiced Nightengale </b>style for Essence.</li> <li>A version of <b>Thaumaturgy</b> as a tertiary merit or sorcery mode based around adding flexible ways to engage with existing magic in the setting and rules, with options for using skills other than Sagacity.</li> </ul>Along with material for storytellers including\u200b<ul><li>A <b>design guide for Antagonists</b> that sort them into 4 <b>Scion-like statblock tiers</b>, divide innate qualities from those worth tracking and recommendations for applying charms as qualities.\u200b<ul><li>Includes <b>fillable pdfs</b> and a <b>quick version</b> for easy referencing mid-play</li> </ul></li> <li>An attempt at <b>Spear Empress Bhadri</b>\u200b using those rules</li> <li>Quick, base power-only conversions of the <b>artifacts</b> in the <b>Tomb of Dreams</b> intro adventure for compatibility, along with quick <b>Essence versions of the ToD NPCs</b>.\u200b</li> <li>A collection of 61 antagonist <b>qualities for Heroic Mortal antagonists</b>, 10 for each statblock in Essence along with 1 for mortals invested with limited access to magical charms akin to Strange Beast.</li> <li>New rules for <b>Scene Qualities</b> that provide Qualities to describe the physical and social traits of a scene to direct and modify challenges, including a list of example scenes.</li> </ul>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26927,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26927-sylvanvixen","user":"SylvanVixen","date":". 10-23-2023, 02:28 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26927-sylvanvixen","name":"SylvanVixen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-21T14:47:46-07:00","id":1524372,"title":"","content":"Wow, I like all of this material, thank you so much for sharing. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","da